+- `source/services/agent-runtime/application-run-loop.cost.test.ts`: completed, failed, and cancelled per-request cost records with deterministic models.
+- `source/services/retry/provider-failure-classification.test.ts`: pure cancellation versus mixed provider/network failure trees.
+- `source/services/session/turn-outcome-boundary.test.ts`: approval-pause/continuation lifecycle and terminal outcomes.
+- `source/providers/openrouter-decisions.test.ts` and `source/services/approval/decision-shadow.test.ts`: transport deadline/envelope and strict malformed-answer rejection.
+
+## Required assertions
+
+1. Setting absent: no Decisions request and no shadow log.
+2. Tool selection receives the exact final direct + script built-in + ready/collision-free MCP catalog.
+3. Critical wrap-up supplies no tools; mid-turn MCP changes do not alter the snapshot.
